{"seq":2,"slug":"cap-theorem-tradeoffs","title":"CAP 定理与取舍决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/selection-framework/cap-theorem-tradeoffs","wordCount":1733,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"cap-定理与取舍决策\">CAP 定理与取舍决策</h1><p>2000 年 Eric Brewer 提出的 CAP 猜想在 2002 年被 Gilbert 和 Lynch 形式化证明后，成为分布式数据库设计的第一性原理。但在实际选型中，工程师常常误用 CAP——把它当成三选二的静态标签贴在产品上，而非一个动态的、可按操作粒度调节的设计旋钮。本文从 CAP 的精确定义出发，建立一套可操作的取舍决策框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CAP 取舍决策框架的三个关键认知：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CAP 是动态的</strong>：同一系统可以在不同操作上做不同的 C/A 选择，而非整体贴一个静态标签</li>\n<li><strong>PACELC 更实用</strong>：它补充了非分区状态下的延迟-一致性取舍，覆盖了 99.9% 的正常运行时间</li>\n<li><strong>一致性是光谱</strong>：从线性化到最终一致有五个级别，每个级别的性能代价和编程复杂度不同</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"cap-的精确含义\">CAP 的精确含义</h2><p>CAP 定理的三个属性有严格的形式化定义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>形式化含义</th>\n<th>通俗表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一致性 C</td>\n<td>线性化（Linearizability）：每次读都返回最近一次写的结果</td>\n<td>所有节点在同一时刻看到相同数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用性 A</td>\n<td>每个请求都能在有限时间内收到非错误响应</td>\n<td>系统不拒绝服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分区容忍 P</td>\n<td>网络分区发生时系统继续运行</td>\n<td>节点之间的消息可以丢失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键洞察：<strong>分区（P）不是一个设计选项，而是一个物理现实</strong>。在任何跨节点的分布式系统中，网络分区终将发生。因此 CAP 定理实际上说的是：当分区发生时，系统必须在 C 和 A 之间选择。</p>\n<p>用数学表达更清晰。设系统在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 发生分区，将节点分为两个子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Partition</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mtext> is lost</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Partition}(t): \\forall m \\in Messages(S_1 \\to S_2), m \\text{ is lost}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Partition</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ess</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> is lost</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>此时若客户端向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 写入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 读取同一键：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选 C：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 拒绝响应（牺牲 A），直到分区恢复</li>\n<li>选 A：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 返回旧值（牺牲 C），保持响应</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"超越-cap-pacelc-模型\">超越 CAP：PACELC 模型</h2><p>CAP 只描述了分区期间的行为，但大多数时候系统并没有处于分区状态。Daniel Abadi 的 PACELC 模型补充了正常运行时的取舍：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[系统状态] --&gt; B{网络分区?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是 P| C{选择}&#10;    C --&gt; D[一致性 PC]&#10;    C --&gt; E[可用性 PA]&#10;    B --&gt;|否 E| F{选择}&#10;    F --&gt; G[低延迟 EL]&#10;    F --&gt; H[一致性 EC]\">graph LR\n    A[系统状态] --&gt; B{网络分区?}\n    B --&gt;|是 P| C{选择}\n    C --&gt; D[一致性 PC]\n    C --&gt; E[可用性 PA]\n    B --&gt;|否 E| F{选择}\n    F --&gt; G[低延迟 EL]\n    F --&gt; H[一致性 EC]</pre><p>用 PACELC 分类当前主流云数据库：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据库</th>\n<th>分区时</th>\n<th>正常时</th>\n<th>PACELC 标签</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Spanner</td>\n<td>PC</td>\n<td>EC</td>\n<td>PC/EC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aurora DSQL</td>\n<td>PC</td>\n<td>EC</td>\n<td>PC/EC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CockroachDB</td>\n<td>PC</td>\n<td>EC</td>\n<td>PC/EC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DynamoDB（默认）</td>\n<td>PA</td>\n<td>EL</td>\n<td>PA/EL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cassandra（ONE）</td>\n<td>PA</td>\n<td>EL</td>\n<td>PA/EL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MongoDB（majority）</td>\n<td>PC</td>\n<td>EC</td>\n<td>PC/EC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redis Cluster</td>\n<td>PA</td>\n<td>EL</td>\n<td>PA/EL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cosmos DB</td>\n<td>可配置</td>\n<td>可配置</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表揭示了一个重要事实：<strong>同一产品在不同配置下可以表现为不同的 PACELC 类别</strong>。Cosmos DB 的五种一致性级别（Strong → Bounded Staleness → Session → Consistent Prefix → Eventual）就是这种可调性的典型体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性级别的操作语义\">一致性级别的操作语义</h2><p>线性化并非唯一的一致性模型。现代分布式数据库提供了一个一致性光谱，每个级别都有明确的操作语义和性能代价：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Linearizable</mtext><mo>⊃</mo><mtext>Sequential</mtext><mo>⊃</mo><mtext>Causal</mtext><mo>⊃</mo><mtext>Session</mtext><mo>⊃</mo><mtext>Eventual</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Linearizable} \\supset \\text{Sequential} \\supset \\text{Causal} \\supset \\text{Session} \\supset \\text{Eventual}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Linearizable</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊃</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sequential</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊃</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Causal</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊃</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Session</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊃</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Eventual</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>从强到弱，延迟递减但程序推理难度递增：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>一致性级别</th>\n<th>延迟开销</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>代表产品配置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性化</td>\n<td>+跨 AZ RTT（1-5ms）</td>\n<td>金融交易、分布式锁</td>\n<td>Spanner、Aurora DSQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界过期</td>\n<td>+配置的 staleness 窗口</td>\n<td>排行榜、库存显示</td>\n<td>Cosmos DB bounded</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话一致</td>\n<td>本地读延迟</td>\n<td>用户自己的写可见</td>\n<td>MongoDB session</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果一致</td>\n<td>本地读延迟</td>\n<td>社交动态流</td>\n<td>CockroachDB follower reads</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>缓存预热、推荐列表</td>\n<td>DynamoDB eventual</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择一致性级别时，核心问题是：<strong>如果用户看到了过期数据，业务后果是什么？</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>后果是「资金错误」→ 必须线性化</li>\n<li>后果是「多扣一次库存然后退款」→ 有界过期 + 补偿事务</li>\n<li>后果是「推荐列表少显示一条」→ 最终一致足够</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"取舍决策矩阵\">取舍决策矩阵</h2><p>将 <a href=\"workload-analysis-methodology\">工作负载分析</a> 的输出与一致性需求交叉，得到选型约束矩阵：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工作负载特征</th>\n<th>一致性需求</th>\n<th>推荐方向</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>读密集 + 全球分布</td>\n<td>最终/会话</td>\n<td>多区域读副本</td>\n<td>写延迟增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读密集 + 全球分布</td>\n<td>线性化</td>\n<td>Spanner / Aurora DSQL</td>\n<td>成本 3-5x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写密集 + 单区域</td>\n<td>线性化</td>\n<td>单主 RDS + 同步复制</td>\n<td>吞吐量受限于主节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写密集 + 多区域</td>\n<td>因果</td>\n<td>CockroachDB / YugabyteDB</td>\n<td>跨区写延迟 50-200ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合 + 弹性扩展</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>Cosmos DB / DynamoDB</td>\n<td>复杂性转移到应用层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分区容忍的工程实现\">分区容忍的工程实现</h2><p>理论上分区不可避免，但工程实践中可以通过架构设计降低分区的影响半径：</p>\n<p><strong>策略一：区域内多 AZ 部署</strong>。同一区域内的 AZ 间网络分区概率极低（年化 &lt;0.01%），因此 3-AZ 部署实质上消除了大部分分区场景。Aurora、RDS Multi-AZ、AlloyDB 都采用这种模式。</p>\n<p><strong>策略二：多区域 Active-Active</strong>。Aurora DSQL 的架构在 2025 年 GA 后验证了一种新范式：计算层、提交层、存储层独立部署并独立扩展，跨区域写入通过分布式事务日志协调，单区域可用性 99.99%，多区域可用性 99.999%。</p>\n<p><strong>策略三：分区感知的降级策略</strong>。应用层通过 circuit breaker 检测分区，自动将写操作降级为本地队列，分区恢复后重放。这种模式适合非金融场景下的 PA/EL 系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"决策流程的可操作化\">决策流程的可操作化</h2><p>将以上理论转化为一个可执行的决策流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从工作负载画像中提取一致性需求（参见 <a href=\"workload-analysis-methodology\">工作负载分析方法论</a>）</li>\n<li>用 PACELC 模型确定系统在分区/正常两种状态下的偏好</li>\n<li>根据偏好过滤候选数据库家族</li>\n<li>对剩余候选者进行 <a href=\"cost-performance-modeling\">成本与性能建模</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个流程的输出不是「最佳数据库」，而是「一个经过约束过滤的候选短名单」——最终选择还需要考虑团队技能、生态成熟度和厂商锁定风险等非技术因素。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>CAP 定理的实际价值不在于给数据库贴标签，而在于迫使工程师明确回答：「当网络分区发生时，我的系统应该拒绝服务（选 C）还是返回可能过期的数据（选 A）？」PACELC 模型进一步追问：「在正常运行时，我愿意用多少延迟换取多强的一致性？」这两个问题的答案加上工作负载画像中的量化指标，共同构成了一个可操作的候选过滤器。记住关键一点：一致性级别可以按操作粒度配置，而非全库统一——善用这种灵活性可以在不牺牲关键路径正确性的前提下获得更好的性能。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CAP 定理与取舍决策","id":"cap-定理与取舍决策"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CAP 的精确含义","id":"cap-的精确含义"},{"level":2,"text":"超越 CAP：PACELC 模型","id":"超越-cap-pacelc-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性级别的操作语义","id":"一致性级别的操作语义"},{"level":2,"text":"取舍决策矩阵","id":"取舍决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"分区容忍的工程实现","id":"分区容忍的工程实现"},{"level":2,"text":"决策流程的可操作化","id":"决策流程的可操作化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工作负载分析方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/selection-framework/workload-analysis-methodology"},"next":{"title":"成本与性能建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/selection-framework/cost-performance-modeling"}}